{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54164","headline":"清弋江田舍 · 张贲","name":"清弋江田舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草木翳荒径，岩阿有竹扉。\n童牛随㹀出，乳燕哺雏归。\n钓艇横幽渚，耕蓑挂落晖。\n罕知盐酪味，父子入城稀。\n（见民国十三年刊徐乃昌等纂《南陵县志》卷四二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张贲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54164.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54164","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}